Host checks of every resized pixel against an independent area-intersection
reference, reference crop and vertical orientation, nearest sampling, constant input levels, temporal history reset,
complete RGB565 encoding, and button debounce, edge retention, held-at-boot behavior and tick wrap.
Written for modules.cpp; no vendor code or camera hardware required.
